      "topics": ["tenant.tenant.events"],
      "direction": {"source": "redpanda", "target": "kafka"},
      "services": ["ecommerce-catalog-service", "ecommerce-image-service"],
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "configuration", "reference": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-catalog-service.yaml:35", "note": "earliest would replay the topic if no offset exists"},
        {"kind": "configuration", "reference": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-image-service.yaml:27"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8-switch-config",
      "action": "In the two values files, change kafka.brokers inside the config block from \"redpanda:29092\" to \"kafka:29092\" and change nothing else. Regenerate the two ConfigMaps (ecommerce-catalog-service-config, ecommerce-image-service-config, key config.yaml) from the edited values, apply them with kubectl, and check the applied content. Do not start Tilt and do not commit.",
      "services": ["ecommerce-catalog-service", "ecommerce-image-service"],
      "files": [
        {"path": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-catalog-service.yaml", "keys": ["config.kafka.brokers"]},
        {"path": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-image-service.yaml", "keys": ["config.kafka.brokers"]}
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "configuration", "reference": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-catalog-service.yaml:31-32"},
        {"kind": "configuration", "reference": "src/ecommerce-infrastructure/environments/local/values/ecommerce-image-service.yaml:23-24"},
        {"kind": "broker_tool", "reference": "kubectl get configmap ecommerce-catalog-service-config -n dev -o yaml", "note": "ConfigMap applied by tilt via kubectl; key config.yaml"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9-start-moved-services",
      "action": "Scale ecommerce-catalog-service and ecommerce-image-service back to 1 replica and wait for rollout Ready. On Kafka, check that groups ecommerce-catalog-service (tenant.tenant.events) and ecommerce-image-service (tenant.tenant.events, catalog.product.events) are Stable and did not replay tenant.tenant.events. Check that no new members joined the Redpanda groups of these two services. Stop on failure.",
      "topics": ["tenant.tenant.events", "catalog.product.events"],
      "services": ["ecommerce-catalog-service", "ecommerce-image-service"],
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "broker_tool", "reference": "kubectl get deploy,configmap -n dev", "note": "original replicas 1/1"}
      ]
    },
